    "is_free": false,
    "controller_support": "full",
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3265750/extras/bbf795194cf17a0eddd0734454bf0598.avif?t=1754915311\" data-has-big width=800 height=272 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Saci: The Cursed Hunt</strong> is a first-person horror game inspired by <strong>Brazilian folklore</strong>. Step into a cursed forest where myth and reality blur. Survive the hunt of the legendary one-legged trickster spirit: Saci. With dynamic weather, a procedurally generated forest, haunting visuals, and intense encounters, every trail leads deeper into forgotten legend.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Survive the night or become another victim of the jungle\u2019s deadly legend.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Key Features:</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Dynamic Environment</strong>: Explore the Amazon Jungle with realistic weather and wildlife.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Saci\u2019s Tricks</strong>: Face visual pranks and shifting landscapes designed to confuse you.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Stealth and Survival</strong>: Avoid wildlife predators while gathering the objects.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Exploration</strong>: Discover hidden caves, ancient ruins, and unravel the jungle\u2019s secrets.</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Who is Saci?</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3265750/extras/70d63b1de3ede6fa7adf6a2c25aa5ac9.poster.avif?t=1754915311\" width=600 height=374 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3265750/extras/70d63b1de3ede6fa7adf6a2c25aa5ac9.webm?t=1754915311\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3265750/extras/70d63b1de3ede6fa7adf6a2c25aa5ac9.mp4?t=1754915311\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game draws from Brazilian folklore, where <strong>Saci-Perer\u00ea</strong> is not only a mischievous <strong>trickster</strong> but also one of the <strong>guardians of the Amazon forest</strong>. Known for his one-legged figure, magical red cap, and pipe, Saci controls whirlwinds and alters the jungle to confuse travellers. In this version, Saci\u2019s dark past as a former enslaved child who lost his leg adds a tragic edge to his pranks. He warps the environment with illusions and traps to stop you from capturing him. <strong>Survive and find five objects to trap Saci and escape his cursed domain.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3265750/extras/bbf795194cf17a0eddd0734454bf0598.avif?t=1754915311\" data-has-big width=800 height=272 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Saci: The Cursed Hunt</strong> is a first-person horror game inspired by <strong>Brazilian folklore</strong>. Step into a cursed forest where myth and reality blur. Survive the hunt of the legendary one-legged trickster spirit: Saci. With dynamic weather, a procedurally generated forest, haunting visuals, and intense encounters, every trail leads deeper into forgotten legend.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Survive the night or become another victim of the jungle\u2019s deadly legend.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Key Features:</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Dynamic Environment</strong>: Explore the Amazon Jungle with realistic weather and wildlife.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Saci\u2019s Tricks</strong>: Face visual pranks and shifting landscapes designed to confuse you.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Stealth and Survival</strong>: Avoid wildlife predators while gathering the objects.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Exploration</strong>: Discover hidden caves, ancient ruins, and unravel the jungle\u2019s secrets.</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Who is Saci?</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3265750/extras/70d63b1de3ede6fa7adf6a2c25aa5ac9.poster.avif?t=1754915311\" width=600 height=374 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3265750/extras/70d63b1de3ede6fa7adf6a2c25aa5ac9.webm?t=1754915311\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3265750/extras/70d63b1de3ede6fa7adf6a2c25aa5ac9.mp4?t=1754915311\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game draws from Brazilian folklore, where <strong>Saci-Perer\u00ea</strong> is not only a mischievous <strong>trickster</strong> but also one of the <strong>guardians of the Amazon forest</strong>. Known for his one-legged figure, magical red cap, and pipe, Saci controls whirlwinds and alters the jungle to confuse travellers. In this version, Saci\u2019s dark past as a former enslaved child who lost his leg adds a tragic edge to his pranks. He warps the environment with illusions and traps to stop you from capturing him. <strong>Survive and find five objects to trap Saci and escape his cursed domain.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
